    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Happy Hamster Farms isn't so happy after all.</strong></h2>Dexter's whole nine months of life has been surrounded by cold tile, fluorescent lighting, and Happy Hamster Farms' own genetically mutated &quot;Deluxe Hamsters&quot;. When he sees a golden opportunity to escape, he knows he can't spend one more minute trapped in this horrific place.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chomp and Shoot your way to freedom!</strong></h2>Dexter knows how to use what god gave him; He's got a great pair of cheeks and isn't afraid to use them!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Packed with secrets and lots of things to collect!</strong></h2>6 unique levels to beat and 12 collectibles to find! Find the secret level to get all there is to find!",
